<section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">WE’RE HERE TO HELP</p><h1>Support & safety.</h1><p>Tell us about a concern, a ride, or something we can improve.</p></section><div class="support-layout"><form method="post" class="form-panel support-form"><h2>Contact MAPIDO</h2><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?= e(csrf_token()) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="support"><input type="hidden" name="return_page" value="support"><?php if(!current_user()): ?><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="email">Your email</label><input class="form-control" id="email" name="email" type="email" maxlength="190" required></div><?php endif; ?><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="kind">What is this about?</label><select class="form-select" id="kind" name="kind"><option>Support</option><option>Complaint</option><option>User report</option><option>Ride report</option><option>Emergency report</option></select></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="subject">Subject</label><input class="form-control" id="subject" name="subject" maxlength="160" required></div><div class="mb-4"><label class="form-label" for="body">Details</label><textarea class="form-control" id="body" name="body" rows="5" maxlength="3000" required></textarea></div><button class="btn btn-primary">Send to support <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></form><aside class="safety-notes"><span class="safety-symbol">!</span><h2>Travel thoughtfully.</h2><ul><li>Confirm the route, pickup point and contribution before setting out.</li><li>Meet in a public, well-lit place and share your itinerary with someone you trust.</li><li>Check vehicle and driver details before boarding. Never feel pressured to travel.</li><li>For immediate danger, contact local emergency services directly.</li></ul><div class="emergency-note"><strong>Emergency assistance</strong><p>The report form sends information to MAPIDO administrators only. It does not contact emergency services or guarantee an